(i) Entrusting any person with property or with any dominion over property;
(ii) That person has dishonestly mis- Ram Niwas Gupta vs The State Of West Bengal & Anr on 21 March, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/133382073/
